{%- comment -%}
  horizon-blocks Phase 11 — `_product-badges` private gallery-child block.

  NOT a stock Horizon block. Bridges Dawn's M&P badge engine
  (snippets/card-product-badges.liquid — untouched, still serves live cards)
  into the hz card chain as an editor-manageable block with real settings
  (replaces the Phase-10 badge hardcode in blocks/_product-card-gallery.liquid).

  Architecture:
  - Rendered via the gallery's `{% content_for 'blocks' %}` inside its
    `children` capture, so the positioning context stays `.card-gallery`
    (position: relative) — positions mean corners OF THE IMAGE, matching
    live Dawn (whose .card__badge overlays the media).
  - Wrapper = Horizon `.product-badges product-badges--{position}` (absolute
    inset math + the zoom-out hide in card-gallery.liquid). `bottom-right`
    is an M&P addition (stock Horizon ships only 3 positions) — rule in the
    block stylesheet below, mirroring the stock inset math verbatim
    (including stock's --padding-inline-start quirk on right offsets).
  - Setting DEFAULTS pin what live RENDERS (settings_data values,
    serve-measured 2026-07-05), NOT Dawn's settings_schema defaults —
    live overrides most of them: badge_position "top left" (schema says
    bottom left), corner radius 0 (schema 40), sale/custom/RWS/MTO schemes
    all scheme-1 (schema scheme-5/3/3/2); only sold-out (scheme-3) agrees.
    Replace posture = match the rendered storefront.
  - Badge spans = Dawn-native `.badge color-{scheme}` (base.css:2942), NOT
    Horizon's `.product-badges__badge`: that class consumes full-color
    --color-foreground, which Dawn's `.color-scheme-N` classes redefine as
    comma triplets (dual-format collision). Dawn's `.badge` consumes the
    triplets composed — pixel parity with live cards by construction.
  - --badge-corner-radius is emitted on the wrapper with theme.liquid:196's
    ÷10-rem math (deliberately rem, NOT px@16, so it tracks body_scale
    exactly like live badges).

  Engine parity with snippets/card-product-badges.liquid:
  - Every product tag containing 'Badge-' renders one badge; label = text
    after the prefix. All tag badges share one scheme (live behavior:
    coming_soon_badge_color_scheme colors every Badge- tag).
  - Then at most ONE of: Sold out (suppressed when the product carries the
    'Badge-Coming Soon' tag, or when show_sold_out is off — subsumes the
    hide_sold_out_badge param, which only native collection-preview-grid
    passes) > Sale (compare_at > price) > bare tag 'RWS' > bare tag
    'made-to-order' ("Made-to-Order").
  - Dropped vs the snippet: preview_badge param (native S5 preview machinery
    only; the Badge-Coming Soon tag path covers Coming-Soon here) and the
    per-span id= attrs (duplicate-id junk in the source; nothing consumes
    them). Buyer strings hardcoded ("Sold out" / "Sale") per the port's
    t:-hardcoding convention — the live snippet reads
    products.product.sold_out / on_sale, both render the same English.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% assign product = closest.product %}

{% unless product == blank %}
  {% liquid
    assign tags_str = product.tags | join: ','
    assign coming_soon = false
    if tags_str contains 'Badge-Coming Soon'
      assign coming_soon = true
    endif
  %}
  <div
    class="product-badges product-badges--{{ block.settings.badge_position }}"
    style="--badge-corner-radius: {{ block.settings.badge_corner_radius | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    {% if tags_str contains 'Badge-' %}
      {% assign custom_tags = '' | split: '😉' %}

      {% for tag in product.tags %}
        {% if tag contains 'Badge-' %}
          {% assign custom_tag = tag | split: 'Badge-' | last | split: '😉' %}
          {% assign custom_tags = custom_tags | concat: custom_tag %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}

      {%- if custom_tags.size > 0 -%}
        {% for custom_tag in custom_tags %}
          <span class="badge color-{{ block.settings.custom_color_scheme }}">
            {{ custom_tag }}
          </span>
        {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endif %}

    {% if product.available == false and coming_soon == false %}
      {%- if block.settings.show_sold_out -%}
        <span class="badge color-{{ block.settings.sold_out_color_scheme }}">Sold out</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    {% elsif product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
      <span class="badge color-{{ block.settings.sale_color_scheme }}">Sale</span>
    {% elsif product.tags contains 'RWS' %}
      <span class="badge color-{{ block.settings.rws_color_scheme }}">RWS</span>
    {% elsif product.tags contains 'made-to-order' %}
      <span class="badge color-{{ block.settings.mto_color_scheme }}">Made-to-Order</span>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
{% endunless %}

{% render 'product-badges-styles' %}

{% stylesheet %}
  .product-badges--bottom-right {
    bottom: calc(var(--badge-inset) + var(--padding-block-start));
    right: calc(var(--badge-inset) + var(--padding-inline-start));
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Badges",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Displays Badge- tag, Sold out, Sale, RWS, and Made-to-Order badges from parent product"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "badge_position",
      "label": "Position",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "bottom-left",
          "label": "Bottom left"
        },
        {
          "value": "bottom-right",
          "label": "Bottom right"
        },
        {
          "value": "top-left",
          "label": "Top left"
        },
        {
          "value": "top-right",
          "label": "Top right"
        }
      ],
      "default": "top-left"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "badge_corner_radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Corner radius",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_sold_out",
      "label": "Show sold-out badge",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Colors"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "sale_color_scheme",
      "label": "Sale badge",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "sold_out_color_scheme",
      "label": "Sold-out badge",
      "default": "scheme-3"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "custom_color_scheme",
      "label": "Tag badges (Badge-)",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "rws_color_scheme",
      "label": "RWS badge",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "mto_color_scheme",
      "label": "Made-to-Order badge",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Badges",
      "category": "Product"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
